<div class="home-section-band border-top border-bottom mb-5">
    <div class="container">
        <p class="text-muted small text-uppercase fw-semibold mb-2">Architecture</p>
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Design Principles</h2>
        <div class="row g-3 mb-0">
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <span class="badge text-bg-primary mb-2">01</span>
                    <h3 class="h6 fw-semibold">Decision quality</h3>
                    <p class="small mb-0">
                        Enterprise software has historically suffered from complexity, rigidity, and implementation burden.
                        We approached development with disciplined criteria: every capability must improve decision quality,
                        reduce operational effort, or strengthen compliance posture. Features that fail these criteria are
                        excluded regardless of market demand.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <span class="badge text-bg-primary mb-2">02</span>
                    <h3 class="h6 fw-semibold">Security architecture</h3>
                    <p class="small mb-0">
                        Security architecture reflects this discipline. Encryption is comprehensive and mandatory. Audit trails
                        are complete and immutable. Access controls are granular and enforced. These characteristics align with
                        ISO 27001 standards and satisfy the compliance frameworks that regulated industries require. They are
                        not optional enhancements but foundational elements of the platform design.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <span class="badge text-bg-primary mb-2">03</span>
                    <h3 class="h6 fw-semibold">Operational reality</h3>
                    <p class="small mb-0">
                        Practical operational realities also inform our architecture. Connectivity varies across locations, so
                        offline capability and synchronization are standard. Legacy system coexistence is anticipated through
                        robust integration capabilities. Geographic distribution is accommodated through architecture designed
                        for multi-regional deployment.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
